  "question": {
    "text": "Four persons can hit a target correctly with probabilities <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> respectively. If all hit at the target independently, then the probability that the target would be hit, is",
    "image": null
  },
